{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>招牌花生忌廉/開心果/柑桔/紅薯</p><p>韓國冬甩名店ABEBE BAKERY登港</p><p>韓國濟州島人氣冬甩名店 ABEBE BAKERY 宣佈登陸香港，預計9月於尖沙咀開幕。品牌以結合在地食材與創意烘焙聞名，近年從濟州島紅到首爾、日本，如今更將招牌爆餡冬甩及麵包帶到香港，相信定必掀起排隊熱潮！</p><p>堅持使用濟州島代表性食材！</p><p>ABEBE BAKERY 最大特色，在於「把濟州島的味道融入冬甩裡」。品牌堅持使用濟州島代表性食材，如柑桔、綠茶、花生、紅薯等，口感亦有別於傳統美式冬甩的蓬鬆，帶有獨特嚼勁的QQ口感，近似年糕的質感，深受亞洲食客喜愛。</p><p>提供多款特色冬甩口味！</p><p>ABEBE BAKERY 提供多款特色冬甩口味，招牌有牛島花生、濟州綠茶、濟州特產漢拿峰柑桔、濟州紅薯、開心果等人氣口味，每款外皮微脆、內裡柔軟又爆漿。期待香港會推出獨家限定口味！</p><p>ABEBE BAKERY 備註：預計9月尖沙咀開幕 官方IG：@bakery_abebe</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178556403078148017_374528666a6d8b7f09a48.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/17855640318103019_16049241936a6d8b7ff1683.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178556403319894973_10658834166a6d8b815f24d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178556403458885044_14820481156a6d8b82d7483.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178556403638287853_20217326416a6d8b84c8c58.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178556403815967707_19307532586a6d8b86634f2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178556403971370640_11671697286a6d8b880349a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178556404210259128_7792447026a6d8b8a4944a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178556404349575390_12907368616a6d8b8bb5b2e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-01T07:52:18.476378+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":490,"images":9,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}